# GarageFlow — Task 3: Table Column Definitions

Defines the columns for each table identified in Task 2.
Organized by the same four categories established in Task 2.

---

## Structure of a Garage

### `garage`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| garage_id | INT | Unique identifier for the garage |
| name | VARCHAR | Name of the garage |
| total_capacity | INT | Total number of parking spots across all floors |
| number_of_floors | INT | Number of floors in the garage |
| operating_hours | VARCHAR | Hours of operation (e.g. "6:00am–midnight") |
| front_desk_phone | VARCHAR | Front desk contact phone number |

---

### `floor`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| floor_id | INT | Unique identifier for the floor |
| garage_id | INT | The garage this floor belongs to (linked to garage) |
| floor_number | INT | Numeric position of the floor |
| floor_name | VARCHAR | Optional label for the floor (e.g. "Basement", "Roof", null) |
| total_spots | INT | Total number of spots on this floor |
| available_spots | INT | Current number of available spots on this floor |

---

### `parking_spot`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| spot_id | INT | Unique identifier for the parking spot |
| floor_id | INT | The floor this spot belongs to (linked to floor) |
| spot_type | ENUM | Type of spot: standard, handicap, staff |
| status | ENUM | Current status: available, occupied, out_of_order |
| location_reference | VARCHAR | Physical location label (e.g. "A-12", "Zone B", null for small implementations) |

---

### `gate_event`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| gate_id | INT | Unique identifier for the gate |
| garage_id | INT | The garage this gate belongs to (linked to garage) |
| gate_type | ENUM | Type of gate: entry, exit |
| status | ENUM | Current status: open, closed, out_of_order |

---

## Users

### `customer`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| customer_id | INT | Unique identifier for the customer |
| name | VARCHAR | Customer's full name |
| email | VARCHAR | Customer's email address |
| phone_number | VARCHAR | Customer's phone number |
| date_created | TIMESTAMP | Date and time the account was created |
| account_status | ENUM | Account state: active, suspended, deleted |

---

### `vehicle`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| vehicle_id | INT | Unique identifier for the vehicle |
| license_plate | VARCHAR | Vehicle's license plate number |
| plate_state | VARCHAR | State or region the plate is registered to |
| vehicle_type | ENUM | Type of vehicle: car, motorcycle, truck |
| customer_id | INT | Associated customer, if any (nullable — walk-up vehicles have no account) |

---

### `staff`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| operator_id | INT | Unique identifier for the staff member |
| name | VARCHAR | Staff member's full name |
| role | ENUM | Permission level: admin, attendant |
| username | VARCHAR | Login username |
| password_hash | VARCHAR | Hashed login password |

---

## Parking Process

### `ticket`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| ticket_id | INT | Unique identifier for the ticket |
| entry_timestamp | TIMESTAMP | Date and time the vehicle entered |
| exit_timestamp | TIMESTAMP | Date and time the vehicle exited (null until exit) |
| entry_gate_id | INT | Gate used for entry (linked to gate_event) |
| exit_gate_id | INT | Gate used for exit, null until exit (linked to gate_event) |
| spot_id | INT | Assigned parking spot (linked to parking_spot) |
| vehicle_id | INT | Vehicle associated with this ticket (linked to vehicle) |
| status | ENUM | Ticket state: active, closed, lost, voided |
| duration | INT | Total parked duration in minutes (calculated on close, null until then) |
| total_fee | DECIMAL | Total fee owed (calculated on close, null until then) |

---

### `payment`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| payment_id | INT | Unique identifier for the payment |
| ticket_id | INT | The ticket this payment is tied to (linked to ticket) |
| amount_charged | DECIMAL | Total amount charged |
| payment_method | ENUM | Method used: cash, card, mobile |
| payment_timestamp | TIMESTAMP | Date and time the payment was processed |
| payment_status | ENUM | Payment state: paid, pending, failed, refunded |

---

### `reservation`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| reservation_id | INT | Unique identifier for the reservation |
| customer_id | INT | Customer who made the reservation (linked to customer) |
| vehicle_id | INT | Vehicle the reservation is for (linked to vehicle) |
| start_datetime | TIMESTAMP | Reservation start date and time |
| end_datetime | TIMESTAMP | Reservation end date and time |
| status | ENUM | Reservation state: confirmed, cancelled, fulfilled, expired |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | Date and time the reservation was created |
| quoted_fee | DECIMAL | Fee quoted at the time of booking |

---

## System Analytics

### `occupancy_log`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| log_id | INT | Unique identifier for the log entry |
| spot_id | INT | The spot that changed status (linked to parking_spot) |
| changed_at | TIMESTAMP | Date and time the status change occurred |
| change_type | ENUM | Direction of the change: occupied, freed |

---

### `system_event`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| event_id | INT | Unique identifier for the event |
| source | VARCHAR | System component that generated the event (e.g. "gate_controller", "ticket_module") |
| description | TEXT | Free-text description of what occurred |

---

## Operations

### `pricing_rule`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| rate_id | INT | Unique identifier for the pricing rule |
| rate_name | VARCHAR | Name of the rate (e.g. "standard", "weekend", "event") |
| applicable_hours | VARCHAR | Hours during which this rate applies |
| pricing_model | ENUM | Model type: flat, hourly, special |
| description | TEXT | Human-readable explanation of the rule |
| program | VARCHAR | Reference to the function/logic used to calculate the fee from entry and exit timestamps |